</ul>'=>'<p>Nella barra laterale destra, puoi aggiungere blocchi di layout per la tua email:</p>
<ul>
<li>1 colonna</li>
<li>2 colonne</li>
<li>3 colonne</li>
</ul>','Newsletter: Blank 1:2 Column'=>'Newsletter: vuoto 1:2 colonne','<h1 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Let\'s Get Started!</strong></h1>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>It\'s time to design your newsletter! In the right sidebar, you\'ll find 4 menu items that will help you customize your newsletter:</p>
<ol>
<li>Content</li>
<li>Columns</li>
<li>Styles</li>
<li>Preview</li>
</ol>'=>'<h1 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Iniziamo!</strong></h1>
